type: software
title: "From identifiability to protocol design in a two-compartment bioenergetic model of critical power: a simulation study"
abstract: "Source code, synthetic data and reproduction scripts accompanying the manuscript on structural and practical identifiability, estimator efficiency against the Cramer-Rao bound, and protocol design for a reduced two-compartment Margaria-Morton bioenergetic model of high-intensity exercise. Supersedes version 1.0.0, whose ODE residual was incorrect."
